# Allow-list: the build context contains ONLY what the API image needs.
# Everything else (.git, .env, tests, caches, docs, frontend/) is never sent to Docker,
# so secrets cannot end up in an image by accident and builds stay fast.
*
!app/
!pyproject.toml
!poetry.lock

# ...and even inside app/, no compiled files from the host
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
